      "side": 1,
      "message": "It seems like that should work similarly. I replaced changing the system flag with the call suggested, but I don\u0027t see the error path being taken. The reason that I want to take the error path, is to force a detach event for the case where on a power up, the host machine goes into Attached.SRC and has no reason to send SRC CAPs when we jump to RW and set up for full usb-pd on this port. The RWSIG timer is 7 seconds in RO.\n\nWith the flag:\n[9.319569 C0: Applying CC Open!]\n[9.323268 C0: ErrorRecovery]\n\nwith pd_set_error_recovery()\n[9.287188 C0: TCPC init ready]\n[9.288774 C0: Unattached.SNK]",
      "parentUuid": "2ebb683d_4532acb5",
